
GLOBAL WAR 2.21e - QUICK README
          
I salute you, o' mighty Global War Players!

There are several files included in the Global War archive,
so before you start playing around with them, please
read the GWSysop.doc file.     

The file says everything about how to install the program and 
how to get it run quickly. 

If you have Global War 2.20 (or earlier) already installed, simply copy 
all files in this archive over the old ones. 
Note; the Global War game documentation has been updated (GW.doc).
Please replace the old document file with the new.

Here are the contents of this archive:

GlobalWar         The executable
GW.con            Configuration file - edit this as you like!
GW.doc            Online doc; Game documentation
GW2.history       Version history
GWpoints.doc      Online doc; Explains the scores
GWRanks.txt       Rankings file - edit this as you like!
GWSysop.doc       Important information for sysops
GWTeam.doc        Online doc; Describes team games
Poster            A short note about this release
ReadMe1st         This file
